                <image size_to_parent="true" width="192" height="120">data:image/png;base64,</image>
                <doc>Your goal is to maximize profits in this fishing industry.  Your catch will be influenced by the density of the fish population as well as the number of ships you have.&#x0D;</doc>
            </isee:process_frame>
            <isee:process_frame x="286" y="227" width="196" height="113" name="Competitor" show_name="false" color="#6C4098" border-style="double" border-width="thick-thin">
                <image size_to_parent="true" width="192" height="120">data:image/png;base64,</image>
                <doc>Your competitor will attempt to gain more profit than you by aggressively purchasing more ships.</doc>
