                <image size_to_parent="true" width="203" height="130">data:image/png;base64,</image>
                <doc>The fish population is a renewable resource.  As you catch fish, more fish are hatched to bring the population back up to an equilibrium value.  The ability of the fish population to regenerate diminishes with lower population size.</doc>
